; Ceiling bottom is y=90 (the ceiling body sits at y=70 with a 40 px shape),
; so a 48 px hazard centred at y=114 hangs flush beneath it and leaves about
; 160 px of headroom over the ground at y=300 -- enough for a compact swing
; to pass under, not enough for the wide flat arc the hazard exists to deny.
